FAIL testdata/bad/alias-missing.yaml:5:14  PQ1006: timeout uses *short, and no anchor &short is defined

   3 |   - name: only
   4 |     run: ["/bin/true"]
>  5 |     timeout: *short
                    ^

   Define it before you use it:

       shared: &short
         KEY: value

   An anchor has to appear earlier in the file than the *short that reads it.

   paceq error PQ1006  for the full explanation
